+      "judgment": "The unguarded equation gives the complete meaning of the named mathematical summary largestEvenInRange. It does not rewrite a source-program term or skip execution; it is used as the result summary in the all-positive-inputs postcondition.",
+      "relevance": "For positive Y, pyMod(Y, 2) is 0 or 1, so Y - pyMod(Y, 2) is the greatest even integer at or below Y; the interval test returns that value exactly when it is at least X."
+    },
