+      "judgment": "The rule expands the proof harness term #chooseNum(X,Y) into an ordinary Call of a closure containing the exact translated solution body. It does not replace that body with a result oracle or mathematical summary; supplied call, binding, control, operator, and return rules execute it.",
+      "relevance": "It is the entry rule that connects the fixed proof claim to the source implementation under MPY operational semantics."
+    }
+  ],
+  "proved_derived_lemmas": [],
